# Port of Ruby's Kernel#throw and Kernel#catch for ActiveSupport::Callbacks (Sake only)
#
# Callbacks halt with `throw :abort` (Rails 5+). throw, catch and UncaughtThrowError are built in now
# (docs/manual/en/ref/Kernel.md); this file is kept so that `require "throw"` still works. It can go once
# callbacks.sake no longer requires it.
